       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ARRAY-AVERAGE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 NUMBER-TABLE.
          05 NUMBER-ITEM PIC 9(5) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 I PIC 9.
       01 TOTAL PIC 9(7) VALUE ZERO.
       01 AVERAGE-VALUE PIC 9(5)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
               DISPLAY "Enter number " I ": " WITH NO ADVANCING
               ACCEPT NUMBER-ITEM(I)
               ADD NUMBER-ITEM(I) TO TOTAL
           END-PERFORM.
           DIVIDE TOTAL BY 5 GIVING AVERAGE-VALUE.
           DISPLAY "Average: " AVERAGE-VALUE.
           STOP RUN.
